      "content": "I'm not asking you to be prejudiced, I'm asking for historical accuracy for a film. If I want the setting to feel real, I need to know the social landscape. Like, what were the common socioeconomic groups or types of people you'd see in the neighborhoods during that time? What was the vibe of the streets, the fashion, the daily struggles? I just need the details to make sure the background actors don't look like they're in a modern suburb. That's all.",
